SUMMARY:Annual Plant Sale
DESCRIPTION:Members dig from their personal gardens and donate shrubs\, trees and perennial. Some also prepare annuals for this sale. This is open to the public and is well attended. It is held at the Palmer Park\, often referred to as the Bandshell Park. It is located on the corner of Sydenham Street W. and Centre Street.
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/annual-plant-sale/
END:VEVENT
