SUMMARY:Plant Fair 2026: Parkdale & Toronto Horticultural Society
DESCRIPTION:A beloved\, local Plant Fair that’s also a community gardens’ fundraiser!\nFREE admission. A rain or shine event. \n***Featuring***\nNatives\, pollinators\, organic herbs & veggies\, shade lovers & hard-to-find plants. Plus\, a garden flea market\, free gardening advice\, & groovy giveaways! \n***NOT Featuring***\nAnything invasive. Shop with ease knowing that nothing invasive will be on offer\, including unregulated invasive plants (like English Ivy\, Lily of the valley\, Daylily\, Periwinkle\, Goutweed\, etc.) that sadly can still be found at many garden centres. Speak up\, voice your concern! These pests are taking over Ontario’s woodlands. \n***Jumping Worms?***\nWe’ve got you covered! Whether you know about invasive jumping worms or not\, don’t fret when shopping our fair. All donated plants have been thoroughly root-washed\, repotted in clean pots with commercial potting soil\, and stored off the ground. Donated plants are collected two weeks prior to the sale to ensure viability after root-washing. It’s the third year that we are doing this. It’s a lot… but it matters! 💚 \n***Mobility & Accessibility***\nHosted\, once again\, in Roncy United Church\, this accessible space (with ramp access) can accommodate people with mobility devices as well as those bringing wagons and strollers. \n***Gardening Advice***\nHaving trouble knowing what plants to put where? Have a pesky problem with something in your garden? Ask one of our garden experts to weigh in\, FREE of charge. \n***Payment***\nCash\, debit\, and all major credit cards on purchases of $50 or more. \nSee you there! \n– – – – – – – – – – – \nOur horticultural society is a recognized not-for-profit committed to sharing the joys of plant-growing through encouraging school gardens\, outreach that makes gardening accessible to those of all physical and mental abilities\, hosting horticultural talks\, and funding greening initiatives that make for a more livable city. parkdaletorontohort.com
URL:https://gardenontario.org/event/plant-fair-2026-parkdale-toronto-horticultural-society/
LOCATION:Roncesvalles United Church\, 240 Roncesvalles Avenue\, Toronto\, M6R 1M3
CATEGORIES:Community Event,Garden Fair/Festival,Plant Sale
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://gardenontario.org/wp-content/uploads/facebook_event_plantfair_2026-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Horticultural Societies of Parkdale &amp%3B Toronto":MAILTO:plantfair@parkdaletorontohort.com
GEO:43.6455281;-79.4493105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Roncesvalles United Church 240 Roncesvalles Avenue Toronto M6R 1M3;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=240 Roncesvalles Avenue:geo:-79.4493105,43.6455281
END:VEVENT
